Package: relaybay
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: relaybay contributors
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35)
Recommends: xdg-utils
Homepage: https://github.com/Codenator81/relaybay
Description: live board and MCP server for coordinating Claude Code sessions
 relaybay keeps one board of projects, tasks, stages and reports that every
 Claude Code session updates over MCP. This package installs the frozen
 program in /opt/relaybay: the relaybay command (server, setup, doctor), the
 relaybay-desktop tray program and the relaybay-hook forwarder.
